          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/keeping-a-secret-requires-a-good-memory-space-lower-bounds-for-private-algorithms/ >
            
              Keeping a Secret Requires a Good Memory: Space Lower-Bounds for Private Algorithms
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
                        <a class="row-card__small-link" href="/people/106585/">
                          Pasin Manurangsi
                        </a>
                      
